WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:11.818
Hello! Today we will learn about UPI, which lets you send and receive money straight from your bank account using your phone.

00:00:12.518 --> 00:00:17.606
We will also learn how to stay safe from fraud.

00:00:18.306 --> 00:00:23.367
UPI stands for Unified Payments Interface.

00:00:23.367 --> 00:00:29.874
Money arrives instantly, day or night, holiday or not.

00:00:30.574 --> 00:00:36.838
The money goes directly from your bank account to the other person's bank account.

00:00:37.538 --> 00:00:42.722
And you pay no fee for everyday payments.

00:00:43.422 --> 00:00:50.190
Step one: your bank account must be linked to your mobile number.

00:00:50.890 --> 00:00:58.810
Two: download BHIM or your bank's UPI app and add your account.

00:00:59.510 --> 00:01:05.947
Three: create a secret UPI PIN using your debit card.

00:01:05.947 --> 00:01:09.590
Only you should know this PIN.

00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:18.954
To pay, scan the shop's QR code, or enter the other person's UPI ID or number.

00:01:19.654 --> 00:01:25.414
Before entering your PIN, carefully check the name and amount on the screen.

00:01:26.114 --> 00:01:32.210
Then enter your PIN. The PIN is needed only to send money.

00:01:32.910 --> 00:01:36.658
Now listen carefully to the most important point:

00:01:36.658 --> 00:01:40.254
you never have to enter a PIN to receive money.

00:01:40.954 --> 00:01:45.912
If someone says enter your PIN to get a prize or refund,

00:01:45.912 --> 00:01:50.604
know that it is a scam. The moment you enter the PIN,

00:01:50.604 --> 00:01:52.906
money leaves your account.

00:01:53.606 --> 00:01:59.300
Never tell anyone your UPI PIN or the OTP from an SMS,

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:03.518
even if they say they are from the bank.

00:02:04.218 --> 00:02:08.743
A real bank never asks for a PIN or OTP on a call.

00:02:08.743 --> 00:02:17.250
Don't click unknown links, and don't download screen-sharing apps because someone asks you to.

00:02:17.950 --> 00:02:22.880
If money is lost to fraud, don't delay.

00:02:22.880 --> 00:02:29.326
Immediately call the national cyber helpline, 1930.

00:02:30.026 --> 00:02:35.864
File a complaint at cybercrime.gov.in and tell your bank.

00:02:35.864 --> 00:02:42.829
The sooner you act, the better the chance of getting the money back.

00:02:42.829 --> 00:02:46.106
Now test yourself with the quiz!
